# Product pages

## ProductMedia

PDP galleries use the `ProductMedia` custom element — main fade swiper, thumb strip, pagination, desktop `.product-media-video` (image in markup; styles in `product-section.css`).

## Variant media JSON

At bottom of `<body>` (non-blocking):

```html
<script type="application/json" data-product-variant-media>{ ... }</script>
```

Parsed by `media-utils.js`. `ProductMedia` listens for `variant:changed` (`detail.variant`) from `ProductForm` (color swatch change + initial connect).

**Schema per variant key** (color radio `value`, or `"Default"` without color picker):

```json
"Glass Jade": {
  "images": ["...", "..."],
  "video": { "src": "...", "alt": "VILO Ring - Glass Jade" }
}
```

- `images` — 7–9 URLs (markup has 9 slides; 7–9 often duplicate 4–6)
- `video` — updates `.product-media-video img`; may be a src string; if omitted, first gallery image is used
- Legacy array-only values still work

## Default variant edits

When changing the default variant, also update visible gallery `<img>` srcs, `.product-media-video` defaults, and matching `<link rel="preload">` in `<head>`.
